# Worldsoul's Rage ({X}{R}{G}): "deals X damage to any target. Put up to X land cards from your hand and/or graveyard onto the battlefield tapped." Bot1 casts
# Faithless Looting on turn 1 (Black Lotus red), draws an Island and a Swamp and discards the Forest and the Swamp, so a Forest and a Swamp are in the graveyard and a Mountain and an Island in
# hand. Worldsoul's Rage for X = 2 deals 2 to Bot2; of the four land cards only two may be chosen (a third is refused): the Mountain from the hand and the Forest from the
# graveyard enter tapped. The Island and the Swamp stay where they are.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Faithless Looting
Worldsoul's Rage
Forest
Mountain
Island
Swamp
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

